    ["Сменить советника можно в меню Looking for Guidance на компьютере."] = {"You can change the advisor in the Looking for Guidance menu on your computer.","Den Berater wechselst du im Menü von Looking for Guidance auf deinem Computer.","Tu peux changer de conseiller dans le menu de Looking for Guidance sur ton ordinateur.","Puedes cambiar de consejero en el menú de Looking for Guidance, fuera del juego.","Você pode trocar de conselheiro no menu do Looking for Guidance no computador.","조언자는 컴퓨터의 Looking for Guidance 메뉴에서 바꿀 수 있습니다.","可以在电脑上的 Looking for Guidance 菜单中更换顾问。","可以在電腦上的 Looking for Guidance 選單中更換顧問。"},
